01:03.844 --> 01:05.845
your native ground

01:08.046 --> 01:09.848
Your home

01:12.917 --> 01:14.383
You're finally home

01:20.868 --> 01:25.770
The last few words on the floor You don't need it

01:25.950 --> 01:30.032
