02:15.728 --> 02:19.330
So let the painted smile fall down You're

02:19.370 --> 02:26.793
standing on your native ground You're home

02:29.674 --> 02:32.756
You're finally home

02:51.776 --> 02:53.737
You're

02:55.598 --> 02:56.138
home

03:12.864 --> 03:14.105
